flowchart LR
    Legacy[旧 composeApp：KMP + Android App] --> Split[按职责拆分]
    Split --> Shared[shared：KMP library]
    Shared --> AndroidArtifact[shared Android artifact]
    AndroidArtifact --> AAR[AAR]
